      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WOLF JUNIOR (4) returns from a break and is a fresh-up winner. Readied for this with two trials, placing at both, and looks set for a big return. STARDARMUS (3) led throughout to score an effortless win here two back then was runner-up on the turf at Hobart last time. Going well and will take catching in the small field. ALPINE BLAST (6) is a veteran who doesn't win out of turn these days but has a very strong established record here. Change of rider and will be winding up strongly. KIREINA MARUBRAH (5) goes well at the course and distance and is drawn for a soft run. Among the chances. SUGOI LEGEND (7) is next best in a race that drops right away.",
